de-línea-de-comandos","content":"Instala componentes HSM de laboratorio y configura KMS con PKCS#11"},"170":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-92","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"`--softhsm-chart-path`"},"171":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-93","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"`./charts/softhsm`"},"172":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-94","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"Usa otro chart local de SoftHSM"},"173":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-95","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#opciones-de-línea-de-comandos","content":"Fastlane no ofrece un modo offline. Para entornos sin conexión, usa el flujo manual con Helm y prepara un registro y mirror de charts."},"174":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-96","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"`--development` ajusta el realm `lamassu` de Keycloak que genera Fastlane para un entorno de evaluación desechable:"},"175":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-97","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"el usuario `lamassu` queda completamente provisionado (nombre Lamassu, apellido Admin, email `lamassu@lamassu.io`, verificado): no hay pasos de perfil ni de cambio de contraseña en el primer inicio de sesión"},"176":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-98","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"la contraseña conocida `lamassu`/`lamassu` es fija y permanente: no se rota nunca y concede el rol `pki-admin`, incluidos tokens no interactivos a través del cliente `frontend`"},"177":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-99","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"el cliente `frontend` acepta cualquier redirect URI y cualquier origen web (`*`) en lugar de los patrones `/*` originales"},"178":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-100","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"Con `--development`, la contraseña fija `lamassu`/`lamassu` concede acceso `pki-admin` a cualquiera que alcance la instalación. No lo uses nunca en nada expuesto más allá de una máquina de desarrollo o de un host accesible por red."},"179":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-101","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"`--development` se aplica cuando el realm `lamassu` se importa por primera vez. No modifica un clúster existente. Puede combinarse con `--sample-data`: la transformación de desarrollo se ejecuta primero y después se añaden los datos de ejemplo a la misma configuración del realm."},"180":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-102","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"Fastlane:"},"181":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-103","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"valida las herramientas locales y el clúster seleccionado"},"182":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-104","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala o actualiza Envoy Gateway 1.8 y crea la `GatewayClass` `eg`"},"183":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"crea el namespace"},"184":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-106","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala PostgreSQL y crea las bases de datos necesarias"},"185":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-107","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala Keycloak y crea el realm `lamassu`, el cliente frontend, el rol administrador y el usuario inicial"},"186":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-108","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala RabbitMQ"},"187":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-109","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala opcionalmente observabilidad y componentes HSM de laboratorio"},"188":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-110","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"genera `lamassu.yaml` e instala el chart de Lamassu"},"189":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-111","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"carga datos de ejemplo opcionalmente"},"190":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-112","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"La configuración generada expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del mismo Gateway y provisiona al usuario inicial `lamassu` como superadministrador de Lamassu."},"191":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-113","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Al proporcionar `--tls-crt` y `--tls-key`, Fastlane crea el Secret `downstream-provided-crt` y configura `tls.type: external`."},"192":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-114","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Sin ellos, configura cert-manager con un emisor self-signed. Es adecuado para laboratorio, pero los clientes no confiarán en él hasta que distribuyas la CA. Usa Helm si necesitas un Issuer corporativo, un emisor ACME público o un Secret existente gestionado por otro sistema."},"193":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-115","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"El modo no interactivo genera contraseñas aleatorias para los administradores de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak. El acceso inicial a Lamassu es `lamassu` / `lamassu` y obliga a cambiar la contraseña en el primer uso, salvo que se haya usado `--development`: en ese caso la contraseña permanece fija y permanente."},"194":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-116","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Fastlane escribe `lamassu.yaml` en el directorio actual e incluye credenciales en él."},"195":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-117","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Protege el archivo de valores generado, guarda las credenciales en un almacén de secretos apropiado y no reutilices la configuración de identidad de evaluación en producción."},"196":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-118","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#verifica-la-instalación","content":"Abre `https://pki.example.com` e inicia sesión con el usuario inicial. Si el Gateway está programado pero la URL no es accesible, sigue las comprobaciones de Expón el Gateway."},"197":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"page","content":"Instala con Helm","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm"},"198":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-0","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","content":"Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes."},"199":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-1","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Instala Lamassu con Helm"},"200":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-2","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Antes de comenzar"},"201":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-3","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"1\\. Instala los requisitos del Gateway"},"202":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-4","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"2\\. Crea un archivo de valores"},"203":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-5","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"TLS con un Secret existente"},"204":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-6","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Provisiona el primer administrador"},"205":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-7","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"3\\. Instala Lamassu"},"206":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-8","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"4\\. Verifica el despliegue"},"207":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-9","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Decisiones para producción"},"208":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-10","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Usa Helm cuando necesites control explícito sobre identidad, bases de datos, mensajería, certificados, almacenamiento y upgrades. Para un entorno de evaluación en el que el script pueda tomar esas decisiones, usa Fastlane."},"209":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-11","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Prepara los servicios de plataforma que quedan deliberadamente fuera del chart de Lamassu:"},"210":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-12","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un clúster Kubernetes 1.24+ y Helm 3.2+"},"211":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-13","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un servidor PostgreSQL accesible y un rol autorizado para crear bases de datos y schemas"},"212":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-14","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un broker RabbitMQ accesible y sus credenciales"},"213":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-15","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un proveedor OIDC, normalmente Keycloak, con un realm/tenant y un cliente para Lamassu"},"214":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-16","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8+ y una `GatewayClass`"},"215":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-17","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"cert-manager 1.14+; para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS de Kubernetes"},"216":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-18","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"una StorageClass y un diseño de tráfico externo"},"217":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-19","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart usa por defecto una `GatewayClass` llamada `eg`. Cambia `gateway.className` si tu equipo de plataforma utiliza otro nombre."},"218":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-20","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Tú proporcionas el servidor PostgreSQL. El job de pre-install del chart se conecta con las credenciales indicadas, crea las bases de datos `pki`, `authz` y `wfx` y los schemas de los servicios, ejecuta las migraciones y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap`."},"219":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-21","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart no tiene dependencias Helm que instalen PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, un proveedor OIDC, Envoy Gateway ni cert-manager."},"220":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-22","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala o actualiza las CRD de Envoy Gateway antes de su controlador. Estos comandos usan la misma versión que el repositorio Helm de Lamassu:"},"221":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-23","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Crea la `GatewayClass` predeterminada si todavía no existe. Guarda este manifiesto como `gateway-class.yaml`:"},"222":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-24","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala cert-manager por separado antes de Lamassu. El chart actual renderiza sus recursos de issuer self-signed y certificado CA incluso cuando `tls.type: external` hace que el Gateway use un Secret TLS existente. Seleccionar TLS externo no elimina por tanto el requisito de cert-manager."},"223":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-25","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Parte de los valores predeterminados del chart y sobrescribe los específicos del entorno. Este ejemplo supone que PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak son accesibles mediante DNS de Kubernetes y expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del Gateway compartido:"},"224":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-26","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"No añadas `gateway.addresses` por defecto. Deja la asignación de dirección a la implementación del balanceador salvo que tu diseño de red requiera una VIP concreta en Kubernetes. La IP pública de un NAT o proxy upstream no corresponde a este valor."},"225":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-27","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si Keycloak es externo y ya tiene una URL accesible, apunta la configuración OIDC hacia él y omite la entrada `/auth` de `gateway.extraRouting`."},"226":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-28","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"Crea un Secret con `tls.crt` y `tls.key` y referéncialo:"},"227":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-29","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No existe un superusuario implícito. Crea en el proveedor OIDC el rol o grupo esperado por `services.authz.bootstrap` y asígnalo al menos a un administrador antes de exponer Lamassu."},"228":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-30","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El job de pre-install y pre-upgrade aplica el bootstrap de forma idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade los grants que falten."},"229":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-31","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada. Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo del bootstrap, nadie podrá administrar la PKI."},"230":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-32","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para conocer el modelo de principales y políticas."},"231":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-33","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"Para instalar un checkout local:"},"232":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-34","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El Gateway debe mostrar `PROGRAMMED=True`. Si está programado pero no tiene una dirección utilizable, continúa con Expón el Gateway."},"233":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-35","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El test de Helm comprueba los endpoints de salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y verifica la respuesta de la UI."},"234":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-36","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Antes de pasar a producción, revisa:"},"235":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-37","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"backup y recuperación de PostgreSQL y volúmenes persistentes"},"236":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-38","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un motor KMS de producción; el motor filesystem predeterminado no ofrece alta disponibilidad"},"237":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-39","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"almacenamiento compartido para VA antes de aumentar sus réplicas"},"238":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-40","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"roles OIDC gestionados y eliminación de credenciales de evaluación"},"239":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-41","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un emisor TLS de confianza o un certificado gestionado externamente"},"240":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-42","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"recursos, réplicas, autoscaling, disruption budgets y placement"},"241":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-43","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"SMTP, observabilidad y entrega de alertas"},"242":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-44","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"las notas de migración de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` antes de cada upgrade"},"243":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-45","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"La referencia completa de valores se mantiene en `charts/lamassu/VALUES.md` dentro del repositorio Helm."},"244":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"page","content":"Expón el Gateway","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking"},"245":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-0","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking",