erno-nat-o-vpn","content":"Una dirección pública externa puede reenviar TCP 80 y 443 a la VM o a una VIP de Kubernetes:"},"278":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-33","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"La IP pública pertenece al dispositivo externo. Deja `gateway.addresses` sin definir o usa la dirección real del lado de Kubernetes, nunca una IP que el clúster no pueda asociar."},"279":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-34","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Primero decide si necesitas tres data planes independientes o solo tres nombres de host."},"280":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-35","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Requisito"},"281":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-36","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño recomendado"},"282":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-37","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Consecuencia"},"283":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-38","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Varias URL o servicios de Lamassu"},"284":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-39","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Un Gateway con varias rutas"},"285":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-40","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Una IP y un proxy fleet; es el comportamiento predeterminado del chart"},"286":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-41","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Gateways independientes e IP externas distintas"},"287":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-42","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Una VIP por Gateway"},"288":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-43","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Todos pueden usar 80/443; requiere un balanceador con un pool de direcciones"},"289":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-44","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Gateways independientes, un nodo y una IP"},"290":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-45","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Puertos externos diferentes"},"291":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-46","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Los clientes deben indicar puertos no estándar"},"292":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-47","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Terminación TLS/mTLS separada detrás de una IP"},"293":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-48","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Front door con enrutamiento SNI hacia Gateways internos"},"294":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-49","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño avanzado; el front door usa TLS passthrough y cada Gateway termina su propio TLS"},"295":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-50","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Recursos Gateway separados pero proxy compartido"},"296":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-51","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Modo merged Gateway de Envoy"},"297":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-52","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Solo separación lógica; cada listener necesita una tupla única de puerto, protocolo y hostname"},"298":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-53","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Tres Services `LoadBalancer` independientes no pueden reservar a la vez los mismos puertos 80 y 443 mediante K3s ServiceLB. Usa un Gateway compartido, asigna VIP distintas con otro balanceador o utiliza puertos diferentes."},"299":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-54","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Envoy Gateway provisiona normalmente un proxy fleet por `Gateway`. Su modo merged Gateway puede compartir un fleet y una dirección, pero no es un cambio directo para varias releases de Lamassu: los listeners generados usan los mismos puertos y protocolos sin hostnames distintos, por lo que entran en conflicto salvo que personalices el diseño."},"300":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-55","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Usa un front door con SNI solo cuando los Gateways internos deban mantener políticas TLS o mTLS independientes:"},"301":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-56","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Esto requiere hostnames SNI distintos y configuración de red externa al chart de Lamassu."},"302":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-57","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si un Gateway puede gestionar TLS y el enrutamiento, usa el valor predeterminado del chart."},"303":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-58","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los Gateways necesitan políticas independientes y puedes asignar IP, usa una VIP por Gateway."},"304":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-59","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si solo necesitas separar los recursos Kubernetes, evalúa merged Gateway y usa tuplas de listener únicas."},"305":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-60","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los data planes y la terminación TLS deben ser independientes detrás de una IP, añade un front door con TLS passthrough y SNI."},"306":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-61","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si nada de lo anterior es posible, usa puertos externos distintos o cambia el diseño de red."},"307":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-62","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Comprueba, en orden:"},"308":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-63","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El `Gateway` muestra `Accepted=True` y `Programmed=True`."},"309":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-64","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Su estado contiene la dirección esperada."},"310":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-65","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El Service `LoadBalancer` generado tiene una dirección externa utilizable."},"311":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-66","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El puerto 443 de esa dirección es accesible desde la red del cliente."},"312":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-67","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"DNS resuelve al endpoint accesible externamente."},"313":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-68","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El certificado contiene el nombre DNS o la IP usada por el cliente."},"314":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-69","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Gateway API trata las direcciones como estado deseado que el controlador puede asignar o rechazar; consulta la introducción a Gateway API para conocer el modelo."},"315":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"page","content":"Kubernetes self-managed","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment