"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#despliegue-self-managed-con-kubernetes","content":"Ejecuta Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes operado por tu equipo. El chart Helm despliega los servicios de Lamassu y sus recursos de enrutamiento; tú proporcionas el clúster, el almacenamiento persistente, el proveedor de identidad, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y la ruta de red utilizada por los clientes."},"324":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Flujo"},"325":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Úsalo para"},"326":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Qué instala"},"327":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Helm"},"328":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Producción y entornos controlados"},"329":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Servicios de Lamassu y recursos de Gateway API"},"330":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Fastlane"},"331":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Evaluación, demos, CI y pequeños clústeres de laboratorio"},"332":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-16","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"PostgreSQL, Keycloak, RabbitMQ, Envoy Gateway y Lamassu"},"333":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-17","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu es un **chart de aplicación**, no un chart de bootstrap del clúster. Crea los recursos Kubernetes que ejecutan y configuran Lamassu, pero espera que ya existan los servicios de plataforma de los que dependen."},"334":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Área"},"335":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-19","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu proporciona"},"336":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-20","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Tú proporcionas"},"337":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/o